{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34438","headline":"南阳广文欲於荆襄卜居袭美有赠代酬次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"南阳广文欲於荆襄卜居袭美有赠代酬次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知天隐在何乡，且欲烟霞迹暂双。\n鹤庙未能齐月驭，鹿门聊拟竝云窗。\n藓衔荒磴移桑屐，花浸春醪挹石缸。\n莫惜查头容钓伴，也应东印有余江。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}